{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21789","headline":"有鸟二十章 三 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟如鹳雀，食蛇抱礐天姿恶。\n行经水浒爲毒流，羽拂酒杯爲死药。\n汉后忍渴天岂知，骊姬坟地君宁觉。\n呜呼爲有白色毛，亦得乘轩谬称鹤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}